ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi186: Single ADVANCED_FACE on TOROIDAL_SURFACE (major R=5, minor r=2) in CLOSED_SHELL; outer EDGE_LOOP has 4 edges forming a rectangular patch in parameter space; E0 (u:0.3→1.8, v=0.1) and E2 (u:1.8→0.3, v=1.0) have the same u-parameter range — overlapping parametric projections; in 3D they are on different tube latitudes (v=0.1 vs v=1.0) and never intersect; FixIntersectingEdges 2D test fires on u-range overlap and creates false split at phantom 3D intersection IS mechanism; EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND -> ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
